-- הסכם קיבוצי — תיקון הסכם 2011 (11.4.2011): the same parties amend the
-- public-sector framework agreement of 12.1.2011 ("הסכם 2011"). The cost
-- frame runs to 31.12.2012, with a fifth part of 1% for its second half
-- (§4.1.5); its allocation is completed to 4% from 1.1.2012 (not 4.25%) and,
-- by a new step, to 7.25% from 1.7.2013 (§5.1.4), with the 2009 cost
-- (1.7857%) deducted for a body outside amendment 50; the supplement's
-- default steps follow (§10.3–10.4(ב)), and so do the special scales'
-- tables (§10.6); budgetary pensioners who retire to 30.6.2013 are raised
-- by a new column D from 1.7.2013, by an amended annex ד' (§14); §16.1(3)
-- is renumbered 16.2, and the exhaustion of claims runs to 31.12.2012 (§18).
-- Everything else stands (§2(ח)).
--
-- Encoded as an amendment: it imports the framework agreement's module
-- (2011-01-12_framework-agreement_public-sector_tosefet-2011) and states
-- each rule it changes as a rule of its own, calling the framework's rule
-- for the time before. Nothing of the framework is copied. Like the
-- framework, it covers no teaching employee and speaks to no pay item of
-- l4/lib/vocabulary.l4; it is in no root. The Oz LaTmura agreement of
-- 14.8.2011 takes the teachers' rates from the framework "as amended" by it
-- (oz-founding-38 imports it).
--
-- The text is the registry copy the corpus holds; the State Archives copy's
-- further item is not in it and is not encoded.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `2011-01-12_framework-agreement_public-sector_tosefet-2011`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — תיקון הסכם 2011 (11.4.2011)`

DECLARE `2011 amendment action` IS ONE OF
    `demand a further rise for the period to 31.12.2012`
    `negotiate further on pay for the period to 31.12.2012`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 A fax banner; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp (20.9.2011, nos. 7028/2011 and 187/20—, the year's last digits illegible); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 "Between"; no rule.
