-- akn:preamble/p34 A recital: they set the understandings down in this agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p35 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶4: the day of signing, the day written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p4
`the 2011 amendment was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 11 4 2011

-- The first recital: on "12.1.2012" a framework collective agreement was
-- signed between the employers and the Histadrut on the cost frame of the
-- wage supplement for 1.1.2009–30.6.2012 and further benefits ("הסכם
-- 2011"). The corpus marks the date [כך במקור]; the agreement amended is
-- the framework agreement of 12.1.2011 (imported), whose period, sections
-- and annex ד' this one amends (convention
-- instruments.cited-instrument-misdated, put to the lawyer in MMS-598).
@ref akn:preamble/p32
`the agreement the 2011 amendment amends was signed on` MEANS `the 2011 framework agreement was signed on`

`the period the 2011 framework set the cost frame for ended on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2012

§§ `1 מבוא`

-- akn:art_1 The heading of §1.

-- ¶1: the preamble is part of the agreement. ¶2: its headings are for
-- convenience only and do not bear on its reading — the agreement itself
-- answering what convention precedence.heading answers where a text is
-- silent, as the framework's §1 does.
@ref akn:art_1/p1
`the 2011 amendment's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:art_1/p2
`the 2011 amendment's headings bear on its reading` MEANS FALSE

§§ `2 תיקון הסכם 2011`

-- akn:art_2 The heading of §2.

-- The lead-in: these changes are made in "הסכם 2011", from this
-- agreement's signing; each carries its own day where it gives one.
@ref akn:art_2/p1
`the 2011 framework is amended from` MEANS `the 2011 amendment was signed on`

-- (א): in the framework's preamble the period of the cost frame runs to
-- 31.12.2012 in place of 30.6.2012 — the day the framework's own §2 ends
-- its period on (imported). (ב)(1)–(2): so in §4's heading and in 4.1's
-- opening; (ג)(1): and in 5.1's opening.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_c akn:art_2__para_c__subpara_1
`the 2011 framework's cost frame period ends, as amended, on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2012

-- (ב)(3): after 4.1.4 comes 4.1.5: for 1.7.2012–31.12.2012, 1%. (The
-- corpus marks "1.7 2012" [כך במקור], its dot dropped; read 1.7.2012.) A
-- body outside amendment 50 keeps 4.1.1's last paragraph: no 2009 cost.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_3
`the 2011 framework cost frame for the second half of 2012` MEANS 1%

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 framework cost frame as amended for` `the year` `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS
    IF `the year` EQUALS 2012
    THEN `the 2011 framework cost frame for` 2012 `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` PLUS `the 2011 framework cost frame for the second half of 2012`
    ELSE `the 2011 framework cost frame for` `the year` `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50`

GIVEN `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 framework cost frame in all, as amended` `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN y YIELD `the 2011 framework cost frame as amended for` y `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50`) (LIST 2009, 2010, 2011, 2012))

-- akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_3/p2 A fax banner; no rule.

-- (ג)(2)(א): 5.1.2 completes the allocation to 4% from 1.1.2012, in place
-- of 4.25%; (ב): its second paragraph — "not, at this stage, for a body or
-- scale of 4.1.1's last paragraph" — is struck. (ג)(3): after 5.1.3 comes
-- 5.1.4: from 1.7.2013, completed to 7.25%, on §6.1's base. A completion
-- "to" a figure makes it the whole allocation from its day (convention
-- dates.start for each day). Before 1.1.2012 the framework's own 5.1.1
-- governs (imported).
--
-- 5.1.4 ¶2: for a body or scale of 4.1.1's last paragraph (its update of
-- the pension's determining salary not changed by amendment 50), the cost
-- for 2009 — 1.7857% — is deducted "from the completion of the cost in
-- 5.1.2, 5.1.3 and 5.1.4", from 1.1.2012, until the matter is settled or
-- agreed otherwise and approved under §29 of the Budget Foundations Law.
-- F-framework-2011-amendment-a: from 1.1.2012 the only completion is
-- 5.1.2's 1.75%, less than the 1.7857% deducted from it. Read with
-- convention amounts.never-negative: the deduction runs against the
-- completions together, and what it leaves of them is never below nothing,
-- so 5.1.1's 2.25% — which 5.1.1 gives those bodies too — stands in 2012.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_c__subpara_2__cls_a akn:art_2__para_c__subpara_2__cls_b akn:art_2__para_c__subpara_3
`the allocation 5.1.2 completes to, as amended` MEANS 4%
`the allocation 5.1.3 completes to` MEANS 6.25%
`the allocation 5.1.4 completes to` MEANS 7.25%
`the day 5.1.4 completes the allocation from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013
`the cost 5.1.4 deducts for a body outside amendment 50` MEANS 1.7857%

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the allocation §5 completes to, as amended, on` d IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` `the day 5.1.4 completes the allocation from` THEN `the allocation 5.1.4 completes to`
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) THEN `the allocation 5.1.3 completes to`
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) THEN `the allocation 5.1.2 completes to, as amended`
        OTHERWISE `the 2011 framework allocation on` d TRUE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 framework allocation as amended on` d `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS
    IF NOT d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012)
    THEN `the 2011 framework allocation on` d `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50`
    ELSE IF `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50`
         THEN `the allocation §5 completes to, as amended, on` d
         ELSE first
              PLUS `not below zero` (`the allocation §5 completes to, as amended, on` d MINUS first MINUS `the cost 5.1.4 deducts for a body outside amendment 50`)
    WHERE
        first MEANS `the 2011 framework allocation on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) FALSE

§§ `2(ד) — סעיף 10 להסכם 2011`

-- akn:art_2__para_d The lead-in to (ד): the changes to the framework's §10.

-- (ד)(1): 10.3's default raises תוספת 2011 from 2.25% to 4% (in place of
-- 4.25%); (2): 10.4 is called 10.4(א), and raises it from 4% (in place of
-- 4.25%) to 6.25%; (3): a new 10.4(ב) — where by 30.4.2013 no agreement
-- under 10.1 allocates 5.1.4's cost for a scale, its whole cost raises the
-- supplement uniformly for every employee in that scale, its other rules
-- unchanged, and there is no more negotiation on that cost: "for example",
-- from 1.7.2013, 6.25% to 7.25%. Each default is a step, from its day, of
-- what the printed figures add (the framework's rule is otherwise the same:
-- `the 2011 supplement's rate on`, imported, for the time before).
@ref akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_3
`the rate §10.3 raises the supplement to, as amended` MEANS 4%
`the rate §10.4(א) raises the supplement to` MEANS 6.25%
`the rate §10.4(ב) raises the supplement to` MEANS 7.25%
`the last day to allocate 5.1.4's cost` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 4 2013

`negotiation on 5.1.4's cost goes on after the default` MEANS FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `an agreement allocated 5.1.2's cost by 30.11.2011` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an agreement allocated 5.1.3's cost by 30.11.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an agreement allocated 5.1.4's cost by 30.4.2013` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement's rate as amended on` d `an agreement allocated 5.1.2's cost by 30.11.2011` `an agreement allocated 5.1.3's cost by 30.11.2012` `an agreement allocated 5.1.4's cost by 30.4.2013` IS
    IF NOT d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012)
    THEN `the 2011 supplement's rate on` d `an agreement allocated 5.1.2's cost by 30.11.2011` `an agreement allocated 5.1.3's cost by 30.11.2012`
    ELSE `the 2011 supplement's first rate`
         PLUS (IF NOT `an agreement allocated 5.1.2's cost by 30.11.2011`
               THEN `the rate §10.3 raises the supplement to, as amended` MINUS `the 2011 supplement's first rate`
               ELSE 0)
         PLUS (IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) AND NOT `an agreement allocated 5.1.3's cost by 30.11.2012`
               THEN `the rate §10.4(א) raises the supplement to` MINUS `the rate §10.3 raises the supplement to, as amended`
               ELSE 0)
         PLUS (IF d `is on or after` `the day 5.1.4 completes the allocation from` AND NOT `an agreement allocated 5.1.4's cost by 30.4.2013`
               THEN `the rate §10.4(ב) raises the supplement to` MINUS `the rate §10.4(א) raises the supplement to`
               ELSE 0)

-- (ד)(4): 10.6.1, the border crossings: (א) from 1.1.2012 their basic
-- salary table stands at 104% of its amounts, in place of 104.25%; (ב) from
-- 1.7.2013 at 107.25%. (5): 10.6.2, the judges' typists: (א) the whole cost
-- that goes to their basic salary is 7.25%, in place of 6.25%; (ב) 104%
-- from 1.1.2012; (ג) 107.25% from 1.7.2013, of annex א''s table. Before
-- 1.1.2012 the framework's figure (imported).
@ref akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_4 akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_4__cls_a akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_4__cls_b akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_5 akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_5__cls_a akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_5__cls_b akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_5__cls_c
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of their table a special scale is paid on, as amended` d IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` `the day 5.1.4 completes the allocation from` THEN 107.25%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) THEN 106.25%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) THEN 104%
        OTHERWISE `the share of their table a special scale is paid on` d

`the cost the judges' typists' basic salary takes, as amended` MEANS 7.25%

-- akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_4__cls_b/p2 A fax banner; no rule.

§§ `2(ה) — סעיף 14 להסכם 2011`

-- akn:art_2__para_e The lead-in to (ה): the changes to the framework's §14.

-- (ה)(1): 14.1.1's eligible retiree retired in 1.1.2009–30.6.2013, in
-- place of –31.12.2012 (the framework's rule, imported, for the time it
-- covered). (2): annex ד' gives way to the amended annex ד' below. (3):
-- 14.1.3.2's "14.1.[לא קריא]1" becomes 14.1.3.1, "a clerical error's
-- correction" — the reading the framework's encoding already takes.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_3
GIVEN `retired on` IS A DATE, `in an annex א' scale of the State's service on the eve` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an eligible retiree under §14.1.1 as amended` `retired on` `in an annex א' scale of the State's service on the eve` IF
        `an eligible retiree under §14.1.1` `retired on` `in an annex א' scale of the State's service on the eve`
    OR (    `in an annex א' scale of the State's service on the eve`
        AND `retired on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013)
        AND `retired on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2013))

`the section §14.1.3.2 builds on, as amended` MEANS "14.1.3.1"

-- (4): 14.1.3.3's column C reaches retirement in 1.3.2011–31.12.2012, in
-- place of 1.5.2011–. (5): a new 14.1.3.4 — from 1.7.2013 (the pension for
-- July 2013) the determining salary grows by column D, for retirement in
-- 1.7.2012–30.6.2013, and (¶2) where 14.1.3.3 and 14.1.3.4 both apply, on a
-- base with 14.1.3.3's rise. So each column of the table, in its turn, on a
-- base with the rises before it (convention amounts.increase), from the
-- day the framework gives it and 1.7.2013 for D. Before this agreement was
-- signed, the framework's rule and table (imported). A month whose cell the
-- corpus cannot read gives no answer (`the text is missing`, below).
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_4 akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_5
@desc The months of retirement a column of annex ד' reaches (§14.1.3), from the first's first day to the last's.
DECLARE `amended annex ד' column period` HAS
    `its first retirement day` IS A DATE
    `its last retirement day`  IS A DATE

`column A's period` MEANS `amended annex ד' column period` OF DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009, DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2010
`column B's period` MEANS `amended annex ד' column period` OF DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2010, DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011
`column C's period, as amended` MEANS `amended annex ד' column period` OF DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2011, DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2012
`column D's period` MEANS `amended annex ד' column period` OF DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2012, DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2013

`the day column D raises the determining salary from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013

GIVEN base IS A MAYBE NUMBER, cell IS A MAYBE NUMBER, `the column's day` IS A DATE, `the pension month` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `a column of the amended annex ד' raises` base cell `the column's day` `the pension month` IS
    IF NOT `the pension month` `is on or after` `the column's day`
    THEN base
    ELSE CONSIDER cell
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
         WHEN JUST c THEN `raised by the cell` c base

GIVEN c IS A NUMBER, base IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `raised by the cell` c base IS
    CONSIDER base
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST b THEN JUST (b `increased by` c)

GIVEN `the determining salary` IS A NUMBER
      `retired in year` IS A NUMBER
      `retired in month` IS A NUMBER
      `the pension month` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the determining salary raised under §14 as amended for` `the determining salary` `retired in year` `retired in month` `the pension month` IS
    IF NOT `the pension month` `is on or after` `the 2011 amendment was signed on`
    THEN `the determining salary raised under §14 for` `the determining salary` `retired in year` `retired in month` `the pension month`
    ELSE CONSIDER `the amended annex ד' row for` `retired in year` `retired in month`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
         WHEN JUST r THEN `the determining salary raised by the amended row` `the determining salary` r `the pension month`

GIVEN `the determining salary` IS A NUMBER
      r IS AN `amended annex ד' row`
      `the pension month` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the determining salary raised by the amended row` `the determining salary` r `the pension month` IS
    `a column of the amended annex ד' raises` withC (r's `column D as amended`) `the day column D raises the determining salary from` `the pension month`
    WHERE
        withA MEANS `a column of the amended annex ד' raises` (JUST `the determining salary`) (r's `column A as amended`) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) `the pension month`
        withB MEANS `a column of the amended annex ד' raises` withA (r's `column B as amended`) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) `the pension month`
        withC MEANS `a column of the amended annex ד' raises` withB (r's `column C as amended`) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) `the pension month`

-- (6): in 14.2.2's last words, the Histadrut's undertaking reaches the time
-- to 31.12.2012, in place of 30.6.2012 (the rest of it is the framework's:
-- `the Histadrut's pension undertakings`, imported).
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_6
GIVEN `the Knesset passed the amendment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2011 amendment action`
DECIDE `the Histadrut's pension undertaking as amended` `the Knesset passed the amendment` IS
    IF `the Knesset passed the amendment`
    THEN PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
         SHANT `demand a further rise for the period to 31.12.2012`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `2(ו)–(ח) — סעיפים 16 ו-18 להסכם 2011, ויתר ההוראות`

-- akn:art_2__para_g The lead-in to (ז): the changes to the framework's §18.

-- (ו): paragraph 3) of 16.1 is called "16.2" (a clerical error's
-- correction): the havraa clause that is subject to the bill of 16.1.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f akn:art_2__para_f/p2
`the number the 2011 amendment gives §16.1(3)` MEANS "16.2"

-- (ז)(1): 18.1's exhaustion of claims reaches the time to 31.12.2012 (in
-- words, "שלושים ואחד בדצמבר 2012"), in place of 30.6.2012; 18.2's claims
-- stay outside it. (2): in the last paragraph, the time to 31.12.2012 in
-- place of 30.6.2012: no further negotiation on wages or benefits for it.
@ref akn:art_2__para_g__subpara_1
GIVEN `pending in arbitration or a court` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a pending economic dispute declared before the signing` IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2011 framework exhausts the claim, as amended` `pending in arbitration or a court` `a pending economic dispute declared before the signing` d IF
        d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2012)
    AND NOT `pending in arbitration or a court`
    AND NOT `a pending economic dispute declared before the signing`

@ref akn:art_2__para_g__subpara_2
`no further wage negotiation for the time to 31.12.2012` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    SHANT `negotiate further on pay for the period to 31.12.2012`

-- (ח): for the avoidance of doubt, every other provision of the framework
-- stays as it was: what this file does not restate is the framework's
-- (imported).
@ref akn:art_2__para_h
`the 2011 amendment leaves the rest of the framework as it was` MEANS TRUE

