§§ `נספח ד' מתוקן — טבלת הגדלת המשכורת הקובעת`

-- akn:attachments The annexes: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 It replaces the annex attached to the agreement on its signing (its letter illegible; §2(ה)(2) names annex ד'); no rule of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 Signatures in the margin; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 A fax banner; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 Signatures in the margin; no rule.

-- The table by the month of retirement from the service, January 2009 to
-- June 2013: the rise of columns A, B, C and D (§14.1.3 as amended). 25
-- cells print a digit the corpus marks illegible, and so does the month and
-- the column D cell of the last row (June 2013 by its place): those are not
-- read, and a retirement in such a month gets no answer from the table.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/t1
@desc A row of the amended annex ד''s table: the month of retirement and the rise of each column, NOTHING where the corpus cannot read the cell.
DECLARE `amended annex ד' row` HAS
    `the retirement year`     IS A NUMBER
    `the retirement month`    IS A NUMBER
    `column A as amended`     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `column B as amended`     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `column C as amended`     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `column D as amended`     IS A MAYBE NUMBER

`why cells of the amended annex ד' are not here` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "נספח ד' מתוקן: 25 תאים שספרה בהם מסומנת [לא קריא], והשורה האחרונה (חודש ותא בעמודה D)"

`the rows of the amended annex ד'` MEANS
    LIST (`amended annex ד' row` OF 2009, 1, NOTHING, JUST (0%), JUST (0%), JUST (0%)),
         (`amended annex ד' row` OF 2009, 2, JUST (0.2976%), JUST (0%), JUST (0%), JUST (0%)),
         (`amended annex ד' row` OF 2009, 3, JUST (0.4464%), JUST (0%), JUST (0%), JUST (0%)),
